                                "sense_id": "4867d471-1a4c-3c0e-8318-ea89df1952b5",
                                "text": "As an ardent admirer and devotee of Dr José Rizal, he collected Rizaliana material, going to great lengths to woo the sisters of Rizal in order for them to sell to him precious Rizaliana items."
